Observation
USA has produced most of the widely adopted AI frameworks, largely because many leading AI companies and research institutions are based there.
Germany contributed Haystack, a popular framework for search and RAG applications.
Brazil contributed CrewAI, which became well known for role-based multi-agent systems.
Nearly all of these frameworks are open source, while their creators generate revenue through enterprise platforms, cloud services, managed hosting, monitoring, or support.

